00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:20,120
CONVERSATION 2
We’re here with Clémentine Ortega, head designer of the private fashion label L’Orange, to discuss her latest collection.

44
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:23,980
Ms Ortega, how would you describe this season’s look?

45
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:32,020
To be honest, my preferred style has always been on the ambiguous side, and I think this collection is even more so.

46
00:04:32,020 --> 00:04:35,860
I try not to adhere to social norms and expectations.

47
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:42,100
Rather, I always try to incorporate something slightly absurd into my aesthetic.

48
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:47,160
The assortment of accessories in this collection has had quite an impact on critics.

49
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:53,260
The dazzling cape deployed at the end of the show, for example, bewildered many in the audience.

50
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:55,980
What was your inspiration for this piece?

51
00:04:55,980 --> 00:05:03,680
Over the summer, I travelled through rural mountain villages throughout Asia in search of handicrafts to decorate my new studio with.

52
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:08,360
The embroidery done by the women in a particular village was so exquisite.

53
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:11,280
I couldn’t stop thinking about it.

54
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:14,520
Trying to recreate their designs would have been futile.

55
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:18,460
So instead, I applied my own eccentric approach.

56
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:23,840
Using glitter, I drew similar, intricate patterns onto the velvet cape.

57
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:27,760
This ended up in the glamorous, luminous look that concluded the show.

58
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:33,480
It was indeed majestic, and yet, dare I say masculine at the same time.

59
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,240
Well, yes.

60
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,420
That was intentional.

61
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:40,460
I like to merge styles that are often at opposite ends of the fashion spectrum.

62
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:47,900
Hence the sparkling cape was paired with a traditional power suit you would typically see in a business setting.

63
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:51,240
It was sensational if I do say so myself.

64
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,340
Spectacular for sure.

65
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:55,780
A stunning show all around.

66
00:05:55,780 --> 00:06:05,560
Going against stereotypes, the incorporation of indigenous aspects along with your underlying signature touch made this collection a statement of the season.

67
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:19,160
You have proven yourself a formidable young designer, and we can’t wait to see what creations you come up with next.

68
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:36,340
